	('01be7f1a-bb23-47a7-bfed-042f25633d95', 'Imitation with Neural Density Models', 'We propose a new framework for Imitation Learning (IL) via density estimation of the expert''s occupancy measure followed by Maximum Occupancy Entropy Reinforcement Learning (RL) using the density as a reward. Our approach maximizes a non-adversarial model-free RL objective that provably lower bounds reverse Kullback–Leibler divergence between occupancy measures of the expert and imitator. We present a practical IL algorithm, Neural Density Imitation (NDI), which obtains state-of-the-art demonstration efficiency on benchmark control tasks.', '{"Kim, Kuno","Jindal, Akshat","Song, Yang","Song, Jiaming","Sui, Yanan","Ermon, Stefano"}', '3b78fba9-1e0e-4622-8bcd-018ea1b8d903', 'submitted', 'https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2021/file/2b0aa0d9e30ea3a55fc271ced8364536-Paper.pdf', NULL, '2025-02-14 14:40:05.370506+00', '[-0.054016724,-0.026509337,0.054298814,-0.064745896,-0.0047716936,0.013223904,0.07981981,0.014023205,0.03932992,-0.029199595,0.009614685,-0.040521566,0.012402465,0.048446245,0.007148752,0.050605845,0.0059168385,0.041045565,-0.03813191,-0.031083675,0.045011785,-0.08373348,-0.0031292117,-0.036016814,-0.0007010845,0.020995585,-0.090816125,-0.059034985,-0.024459181,-0.20175199,0.0099152345,-0.08084013,0.02846765,0.0028525423,-0.018581836,-0.045044806,-0.045190547,0.07472,-0.025014644,0.022761434,-0.0052154674,0.010421354,-0.018564843,-0.07452819,0.014832695,-0.043515034,-0.05347887,-0.009071501,0.0048579546,0.003074711,0.017935982,-0.01918162,-0.019999674,-0.0032627892,0.0840418,0.010854395,0.056962136,0.037656005,0.07185739,0.07897517,-0.0038647447,0.047241934,-0.1556142,0.032845277,0.055470884,0.055789154,-0.035729714,-0.05607975,0.0101125445,0.011045415,-0.017481336,0.06885618,0.033111695,0.056843497,0.017679509,0.022665448,-0.050484188,-0.05148225,-0.013669109,-0.00019473744,0.028883854,-0.047612216,-0.07979363,0.008246469,-0.040897664,-0.045034863,0.073626794,-