	('0413b72b-44e6-46ff-9d01-f9e36b2a36b8', 'Sample Complexity Bounds for Score-Matching: Causal Discovery and Generative Modeling', 'This paper provides statistical sample complexity bounds for score-matching and its applications in causal discovery. We demonstrate that accurate estimation of the score function is achievable by training a standard deep ReLU neural network using stochastic gradient descent. We establish bounds on the error rate of recovering causal relationships using the score-matching-based causal discovery method of Rolland et al. [2022], assuming a sufficiently good estimation of the score function. Finally, we analyze the upper bound of score-matching estimation within the score-based generative modeling, which has been applied for causal discovery but is also of independent interest within the domain of generative models.', '{"Zhu, Zhenyu","Locatello, Francesco","Cevher, Volkan"}', 'dad17013-323a-4ed2-9e6d-e38b1e60a379', 'submitted', 'https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2023/file/0a3dc35a2391cabcb59a6b123544e3db-Paper-Conference.pdf', NULL, '2025-02-13 18:19:46.080281+00', '[-0.046169292,0.025123635,0.03162544,-0.042714,0.044368394,0.020827472,0.07583431,0.024215603,0.07650101,-0.043524906,0.023553628,-0.02477639,0.039180197,0.07971972,-0.0068819663,0.025645241,0.01843607,0.06931191,-0.05198884,-0.01377768,0.018624676,-0.020060701,0.0020456405,-0.05041362,0.018056683,0.0059842896,-0.01455334,-0.06553104,-0.057462264,-0.2563635,-0.015431591,-0.07861816,0.041678175,-0.008965514,0.031284124,-0.03666319,-0.07155071,0.046083927,-0.022631528,0.031207055,0.004462293,0.03445561,-0.012530415,-0.08796166,0.0060718106,-0.044719413,-0.006921416,0.008287719,-0.030356579,-0.03364094,-0.0023332085,-0.0723694,0.046341,0.08059567,0.02635759,0.062076334,0.049753945,0.050320122,0.030535515,0.042259827,0.010670276,0.053966656,-0.20474336,0.0037742266,0.081231005,0.013530397,-0.041878555,-0.0145221045,-0.001291931,0.043038316,-0.005233969,0.053586908,0.