	('03b8147c-ba20-426c-a837-7b5c113421cd', 'A Model for Real-Time Computation in Generic Neural Microcircuits', 'Henry Markram Brain Mind Institute
EPFL, Lausanne, Switzerland
henry.markram@epﬂ.ch
A key challenge for neural modeling is to explain how a continuous stream of multi-modal input from a rapidly changing environment can be processed by stereotypical recurrent circuits of integrate-and-ﬁre neurons in real-time. We propose a new computational model that is based on principles of high dimensional dynamical systems in combination with statistical learning theory. It can be implemented on generic evolved or found recurrent circuitry.', '{"Maass, Wolfgang","Natschläger, Thomas","Markram, Henry"}', 'e855df86-2848-4c42-817f-8a2ea142ea50', 'submitted', 'https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2002/file/6211080fa89981f66b1a0c9d55c61d0f-Paper.pdf', NULL, '2025-02-14 14:40:48.224495+00', '[-0.0790066,-0.005548758,0.02764031,-0.00022859997,-0.050499078,0.03220323,0.057871178,-0.0008178098,0.019731307,-0.043032378,0.021941632,-0.053764217,0.024748927,0.06527145,0.029232893,-0.009431286,-0.04693179,0.029115282,-0.003558643,0.034717686,0.051121306,-0.027038084,-0.013118711,-0.013286782,-0.043585498,-0.01309155,-0.05241638,-0.03374569,-0.051058564,-0.22679937,0.014016959,-0.029396595,0.023146695,-0.04627008,0.010861235,-0.03262096,-0.05080706,0.048974834,0.004804683,0.049222387,-0.018472627,0.04605103,0.028344544,-0.07938401,-0.033332024,-0.040030524,-0.021393098,0.0047058803,-0.0029996433,-0.04266023,0.003944827,-0.034521427,0.022343576,0.015177679,0.034085922,0.046456102,0.08830676,0.06440051,0.07183542,0.043881986,0.012825947,0.05721567,-0.17611219,0.054261666,0.024284238,0.043424856,-0.02279626,-0.02573348,0.04914256,0.01814977,-0.06553931,0.018126952,0.025316883,-0.0015113167,0.0284614,-0.028248014,-0.027527409,-0.021019485,-0.0046286825,0.049673773,0.020490298,-0.010948263,-0.04093856,-0.052931245,-0.038231045,-0.04228079,0.035210636,-0.041837335,0.012588588,0.017808598,-0.033396672,0.009525079,-0.04233322,-0.04046843,-0.040902488,-0.0063882475,0.040667053,0.0109186545,-0.018533047,0.19714412,-0.03423769,0.040488213,0.026671473,0.0028088603,0.04011974