	('0844f9ee-acb9-4a12-bd7a-5e2416fb2ea9', 'Analysis of Krylov Subspace Solutions of  Regularized Non-Convex Quadratic Problems', 'We provide convergence rates for Krylov subspace solutions to the trust-region and cubic-regularized (nonconvex) quadratic problems. Such solutions may be efficiently computed by the Lanczos method and have long been used in practice. We prove error bounds of the form $1/t^2$ and $e^{-4t/\sqrt{\kappa}}$, where $\kappa$ is a condition number for the problem, and $t$ is the Krylov subspace order (number of Lanczos iterations). We also provide lower bounds showing that our analysis is sharp.', '{"Carmon, Yair","Duchi, John C."}', '577342c0-5187-4d70-a0c1-4ada9d3b9f2b', 'submitted', 'https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2018/file/349f36aa789af083b8e26839bd498af9-Paper.pdf', NULL, '2025-02-14 14:40:26.205842+00', '[-0.06378012,-0.040425595,0.06209468,0.037606943,-0.014856929,0.0007693713,-0.001577234,0.049273916,0.03622107,-0.049573883,0.01295298,-0.04989741,0.025295626,0.036417104,0.016244242,0.052225705,0.012782591,0.029864943,-0.04664488,0.073539205,0.025146626,-0.06237919,-0.030616434,-0.03985149,0.023941277,-0.014270532,-0.049592856,-0.059728067,-0.033099312,-0.25211012,0.010535236,-0.014037971,0.06605369,-0.0045378623,0.024314586,-0.020710053,-0.011972487,0.04037206,-0.04945425,0.021088976,0.010273934,0.059808847,-0.033695437,-0.040745262,-0.018060166,-0.06197731,-0.051433872,0.013056609,0.0013698217,0.014993257,0.029186511,-0.022827,0.021645242,0.036410294,0.019985132,0.031099025,0.0068922574,0.025317833,0.02684,0.035801243,-0.00019231046,-0.034273267,-0.2170408,0.04892937,0.0672659,0.01992862,0.017893136,-0.04495386,-0.026208008,0.066870116,-0.024964776,0.027833667,0.016220989,0.036319606,0.026457574,0.008495197,-0.02549066,-0.016053429,-0.0024597826,0.036780253,0.0076447497,-0.044311486,-0.056248277,-0.052094307,-0.027789997,-0.019581579,0.024624161,-0.05229998,0.0078049516,0.038183212,-0.006887931,0.024918593,-0.008158052