	('019fb18a-bedb-430b-9ee1-84126a861eda', 'Affine-Invariant Online Optimization and the Low-rank Experts Problem', 'We present a new affine-invariant optimization algorithm called Online Lazy Newton. The regret of Online Lazy Newton is independent of conditioning: the algorithm''s performance depends on the best possible preconditioning of the problem in retrospect and on its \emph{intrinsic} dimensionality. As an application, we show how Online Lazy Newton can be used to achieve an optimal regret of order $\sqrt{rT}$ for the low-rank experts problem, improving by a $\sqrt{r}$ factor over the previously best known bound and resolving an open problem posed by Hazan et al (2016).', '{"Koren, Tomer","Livni, Roi"}', '49ac9398-b7c8-418f-a033-2f9768e7f61b', 'submitted', 'https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2017/file/347665597cbfaef834886adbb848011f-Paper.pdf', NULL, '2025-02-14 14:40:29.929925+00', '[-0.08185385,0.036218457,0.023528019,0.037998196,0.012619587,0.025315203,0.004250962,0.040069416,0.018568508,-0.024297098,-0.019752143,-0.047743477,0.021361573,0.061564326,-0.0008733823,0.056799836,0.026604867,0.06857782,-0.0334502,0.039034445,0.020407781,-0.10059718,-0.03073674,-0.085845165,0.028565109,-0.0048168935,-0.06305216,-0.038999688,-0.014741405,-0.20259732,0.0014724495,-0.054909844,0.050846983,-0.009601383,-0.0057786587,-0.02435369,-0.014142855,0.07548211,-0.037896883,0.03538202,-0.009717202,0.022043671,-0.02062113,-0.046830527,0.017430525,-0.03299953,0.014445887,-0.02129369,-0.03205024,-0.024578629,0.013877988,-0.040053017,0.011374271,0.008466285,0.022734165,0.013880871,0.06833492,0.051427662,0.0022490176,0.06334367,0.03550835,0.013204731,-0.14699805,0.047826506,0.054963615,0.029897433,-0.040579453,-0.034279212,-0.0046346425,0.08793358,0.0072541367,0.063187525,0.02777599,0.042851426,0.038638152,0.00047783973,0.014518141,0.009200793,-0.012656397,0.03686604,0.04027659,-0.0422332,-0.07708081,0.0135229565,-0.037742812,-0.05575913,0.02014696,-0.063417464,0.0