	('0203b973-eb08-4a50-8c49-7ed5e5213b62', 'Second Order Properties of Error Surfaces: Learning Time and Generalization', 'The learning time of a simple neural network model is obtained through an  analytic computation of the eigenvalue spectrum for the Hessian matrix,  which describes the second order properties of the cost function in the  space of coupling coefficients. The form of the eigenvalue distribution  suggests new techniques for accelerating the learning process, and provides  a theoretical justification for the choice of centered versus biased state  variables.', '{"LeCun, Yann","Kanter, Ido","Solla, Sara"}', '09215574-3a19-40c9-aecc-20ac89fc3b0c', 'submitted', 'https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/1990/file/758874998f5bd0c393da094e1967a72b-Paper.pdf', NULL, '2025-02-14 14:40:55.236108+00', '[-0.06623952,0.015412353,0.03142095,-0.012550948,0.020610858,0.059237704,0.05031952,0.040378425,0.06700463,-0.02590997,-0.002880792,-0.029312374,0.038707618,0.047589056,0.030898318,0.042364076,-0.016335674,0.0060057845,-0.027861636,0.031157143,0.015781567,-0.03043105,-0.04159811,-0.046027336,-0.0075169583,-0.005485188,-0.027783845,-0.023701169,-0.03601354,-0.23464847,0.058032796,-0.04062601,0.06948203,-0.020324953,-0.0033894123,-0.051325496,-0.0280722,0.036684,-0.030573187,0.02603427,0.024291895,0.042517178,-0.033776492,-0.0357655,-0.021955157,-0.012564731,-0.05043715,-0.029453965,-0.036807436,-0.051415227,-0.0024013342,-0.0056126155,0.054738406,0.0028578297,0.04524933,0.054479625,0.07854282,0.023027588,0.029821526,0.055281807,-0.008192672,0.021796862,-0.19021505,0.05115866,0.052238997,0.033884455,0.012917585,-0.04571547,0.019068727,0.045585122,-0.0019086893,0.026994137,0.035199534,-0.01074434,0.033299938,0.014901852,-0.006282261,-0.028719392,0.013185505,-0.005221678,0.03197359,-0.0047128447,-0.033125255,-0.024307858,0.016010612,0.007049499,0.022806028,-0.023978712,0.0030094131,0.05013725,0.0051543955,-0.03657291,-0.045317832,0.027465345,-0.064065166,-0.0